Releasing graphql-metrics

1. Check the Semantic Versioning page for info on how to version the new release: http://semver.org
2. Update VERSION in lib/graphql/metrics/version.rb
3. Run `bundle install` so Gemfile.lock picks up the new version
4. Add a CHANGELOG entry for the new release
5. Open a pull request with a title like "Packaging for release X.Y.Z" and merge it
6. Tag the merge commit on main with the version and push the tag
  $ git checkout main && git pull
  $ git tag vX.Y.Z
  $ git push origin vX.Y.Z

Pushing the tag runs the Release workflow (.github/workflows/release.yml),
which publishes the gem to RubyGems.org with trusted publishing and creates
a GitHub release with generated notes. No RubyGems API key is needed.
